Hell Emacs: The Infernal JVM Environment
****************************************

Hell Emacs is an enterprise-grade alternative to IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate,
Eclipse, and VS Code for Java and JVM developers, built on top of stock
GNU Emacs.

   This manual documents Hell Emacs, an enterprise-grade JVM hacking
