6 Enhanced Dired
****************

6.1 Enhanced Dired (‘:emacs dired’)
===================================

File management in Hell Emacs is enhanced with:
   • Colored filetype glyphs via ‘nerd-icons-dired’.
   • Batch file renaming as editable text: press ‘C-x C-q’ in Dired to
     enter ‘wdired-mode’.
   • Sorting is stock: ‘s’ toggles name / date, ‘C-u s’ takes any ‘ls’
     switches.
   • Automatic reuse of Dired buffers to keep buffer lists clean.


