7 Workspaces
************

The ‘:ui workspaces’ module provides clean project workspace isolation
using Emacs' native ‘tab-bar-mode’:
‘C-x t 2’
     Open a new workspace tab.
‘C-x t 0’
     Close current workspace tab.
‘C-x t o’
     Cycle to next workspace tab.
‘C-x t p’
‘C-x t p p’
     Open a project in a new tab (stock).
‘C-x t r’
     Rename workspace tab.
‘C-x t RET’
     Switch to a tab by name.

   Each tab automatically formats with project indicators and nerd-icons
glyphs.


