11 Diagnostics and Doctor
*************************

Run ‘bin/hell doctor’ at any time to verify system health:
     bin/hell doctor

   Doctor checks:
   • GNU Emacs version (30.1+, 31.1+) and native compilation support.
   • Installed JDKs (via SDKMAN!, system PATH, or asdf) and JDTLS
     compatibility.
   • Build systems (Gradle wrappers, Maven daemon, Maven wrappers).
   • Language server binaries (Eclipse JDTLS, Kotlin LS, Clojure LSP,
     Groovy LS, LemMinX, Docker LS, Marksman, etc.).
   • Tree-sitter ABI grammars and font icon availability.


